    <string name="bv_sin_bloqueo">To use the Vault, first set a screen lock (PIN, pattern or password): it’s what protects its key.</string>
    <string name="bv_invalidada_corto">The Vault can no longer be opened. Open it from SIOS to see what to do.</string>
    <string name="bv_invalidada_titulo">The Vault can’t be opened</string>
    <string name="bv_invalidada_nota">Its key depended on the screen lock, and Android deleted it when the lock was removed. What was stored is still encrypted and nobody can read it, not even SIOS.</string>
    <string name="bv_invalidada_importar">If you have a Vault export, after starting over you can bring it back from Vault settings › Import.</string>
