    <string name="bv_filtradas_titulo">Check your passwords against data breaches?</string>
    <string name="bv_filtradas_explicacion">The Vault works out a fingerprint (SHA-1) of each password on the phone and only sends its first 5 characters to Have I Been Pwned. The service returns hundreds of fingerprints that start the same way, and they’re compared here. Neither your passwords nor their full fingerprints leave the phone, and the service can’t tell which one you were looking for. You can turn it off at any time.</string>
