    <string name="bv_aj_copia">SIOS backup</string>
    <string name="bv_aj_copia_nota">The Vault isn’t included in the SIOS backup: its key is in this phone’s security chip and can’t leave it, so the backup couldn’t open it elsewhere. To avoid losing it, make an encrypted export now and then and keep it somewhere else.</string>
    <string name="bv_aj_borrar">Delete the Vault</string>
    <string name="bv_aj_borrar_titulo">Delete the whole Vault?</string>
    <string name="bv_aj_borrar_nota">All passwords, codes and documents are deleted, along with the key. This can’t be undone. Without an export, they’re lost.</string>
    <string name="bv_aj_ia">Nothing in the Vault is sent to your AI or to any server. While it’s on screen, your AI can’t read it.</string>
